      "item": [
        "PROVENANCE_TRIO/S101_NOT_IN_SOURCE is stricter than the lane entry format: lines[:3] must be exactly source:/verified-at:/recheck: with no title heading before them, and the source: line must literally contain S101. Most lane entries lead with '# Title'; only 5 corpus/knowledge entries are trio-first.",
